<title>PORTUGAL: PRESS DIGEST - Portugal -- May 5.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Portugal -- May 5.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are some domestic stories in Portuguese newspapers.</p>
<p>PUBLICO</p>
<p>- Portuguese support state intervention in economy, women suffer less discrimination in the work place than in other capitalist countries, according to study by University of Coimbra says.</p>
<p>DIARIO DE NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- From January 1999, national cash dispenser system Multibanco will give its information in escudos and euros.</p>
<p>DIARIO ECONOMICO</p>
<p>- Credito Agricola is preparing to enter the market of car financing in the leasing and long term renting.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
